let __v_654 = Value::from("Overnight oats are soaked in the fridge, not cooked: about 1 part oats to 1 to 1.5 parts milk or yoghurt in a jar, left 6 hours or overnight, then eaten cold with fruit. Rolled oats are the ones that work - steel-cut stay chewy and instant oats go to mush - and a spoon of chia or a grated apple thickens them. You do not need to soak oats before cooking porridge; 5 minutes in a pan does that.");
